@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title AFTER MVP — Proposed / illustrative — Pull request lifecycle and revision-bound readiness
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

[*] --> Draft : if draft capability adopted
Draft --> Open : author marks ready
Open --> InReview : review requested / performed
InReview --> ApprovedContext : actual required evidence for exact candidate
ApprovedContext --> InReview : source / target / required evidence changes
InReview --> Open : changes requested / iteration
Open --> Closed : close without integration
Draft --> Closed : close without integration
InReview --> Closed : close without integration
ApprovedContext --> Closed : close without integration
ApprovedContext --> Merged : guarded native ref update confirmed
Merged --> [*]
Closed --> Open : explicit permitted reopen if supported
note right of ApprovedContext
 Approval is derived revision-bound evidence,
 not necessarily a persisted PR status enum.
 Exact reviewer/self-review/check policy remains proposed.
end note

@enduml
